	id: 'dh', name: 'Daggerheart', long: 'Daggerheart · core rules and SRD 2.0', title: 'A table, not a queue',
	lede: 'No initiative, so no queue. The party sits together, the adversaries below, the GM’s Fear across the top. It wears the game’s own clothes: a night-indigo ground with gold trim, cream paper cards, navy ribbons with chevron ends, and crests with banner labels for Evasion, Armor, Difficulty and the traits. Gold is Hope; violet is Fear. Light theme is the same sheet printed on parchment.',
