		'HP and Stress are slots you mark. Damage is compared to thresholds: Minor marks 1, Major 2, Severe 3; an Armor slot drops it a step.',
		'Adversaries have Difficulty (what players roll against), thresholds, HP and Stress. Minions die to any damage; every X more takes another.',
